'''Gideon's Outland TIE fighter''' was a [[starfighter]] of the [[TIE series|TIE fighter series]] that was present for the [[Clash on Nevarro|clash]] on [[Nevarro]] and was [[pilot]]ed by [[Moff]] [[Gideon]].<ref name="Chapter 7" /> However, it was destroyed by [[Din Djarin]], who placed a [[grav charge]] upon the TIE late in the clash.<ref name="Chapter 8" />

